l_url":"https://github.com/slobodanadamovic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Some types of audit event samples from [our documentation](https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/elasticsearch/reference/7.17/audit-event-types.html) include the port number in \"origin.address\", like **access_denied**:\r\n```json\r\n{\"type\":\"audit\", \"timestamp\":\"2020-12-30T22:30:06,949+0200\", \"node.id\":\r\n\"0RMNyghkQYCc_gVd1G6tZQ\", \"event.type\":\"transport\", \"event.action\":\r\n\"access_denied\", \"authentication.type\":\"REALM\", \"user.name\":\"user1\",\r\n\"user.realm\":\"default_native\", \"user.roles\":[\"test_role\"], \"origin.type\":\r\n\"rest\", \"origin.address\":\"[::1]:52434\", \"request.id\":\"yKOgWn2CRQCKYgZRz3phJw\",\r\n\"action\":\"indices:admin/auto_create\", \"request.name\":\"CreateIndexRequest\",\r\n\"indices\":[\"<index-{now/d+1d}>\"]}\r\n```\r\nbut other types like **connection_denied** from this issue does not include the port:\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\"type\":\"audit\", \"timestamp\":\"2020-12-30T21:47:31,526+0200\", \"node.id\":\r\n\"0RMNyghkQYCc_gVd1G6tZQ\", \"event.type\":\"ip_filter\", \"event.action\":\r\n\"connection_denied\", \"origin.type\":\"rest\", \"origin.address\":\"10.10.0.20\",\r\n\"transport.profile\":\".http\", \"rule\":\"deny 10.10.0.0/16\"}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think we should be consistent here and always include the port number in the \"origin.address\" field.","closed_by":{"login":"slobodanadamovic","id":4357326,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTczMjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4357326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic","html_url":"https://github.com/slobodanadamovic","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/slobodanadamovic/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/86694/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/86694/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}